-- title:
--   Interpolation on the full level-N modular curve with simple poles
-- statement:
--   Let $k$ be an algebraically closed field and $N\ge 1$, and let $F=$ `modularFunctionFieldFullC k N` be the intermediate field of the Laurent series field over $k$ generated by $k$ together with the expansions `qExpand k d (jqModC k)` for the nonzero divisors $d$ of $N$. Places of $F/k$ are valuation subrings of $F$ containing the image of $k$, proper in $F$, and principal ideal rings; each place $v$ carries the associated $\mathbb{Z}^{m0}$-valued valuation and the order function $\operatorname{ord}_v$. Let $U,Z_v,Z_a$ be finite sets of places that are pairwise disjoint, let $t_0$ be a place lying in none of them, let $\beta\in k$, let $\mathrm{val}$ assign an element of $k$ to every place, and let $\mathrm{bad}\subset k$ be finite. Assume $\#Z_v+2g+2\le \#U$, where $g=$ `genusFF` $k\,F$ is the genus of $F$, defined as the $k$-dimension of $H^1$ of the zero divisor. Then there is $g_0\in F$ lying in the Riemann–Roch space of the divisor $\sum_{u\in U}u$, i.e. with $v(g_0)\le \exp(D v)$ for all places $v$ (so at most simple poles on $U$ and no others), such that $\operatorname{ord}_{t_0}(g_0-\beta)=1$, such that $g_0$ is regular at each $z\in Z_v$ with residue $\mathrm{val}(z)$, and such that at each $z\in Z_a$ the function $g_0$ is regular with residue some $\gamma\in k\setminus\mathrm{bad}$.
--
--   This is the standard interpolation consequence of Riemann–Roch on a complete smooth curve — prescribing finitely many values, avoiding finitely many values elsewhere, and achieving a simple zero of $g_0-\beta$ at one further point — stated for the function field of the full level-$N$ modular curve over an algebraically closed field, and proved from the sharp Riemann–Roch equality $\ell(D)=\deg D+1-g$ for that field. It feeds the one-point moving lemmas for prolongation tuples of place specialisations, where residues at the places above $\infty$ and $0$ must be interpolated before lifting.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_exists_mem_riemannRochSpace_ord_sub_eq_one_hasValue_modularFunctionFieldFullC.lean

